# ============================================================
# Hermes-SuperAgent · .gitattributes
# 管 git 对文件换行符 / 二进制的处理，保证跨平台 clone 行为一致。
# ============================================================

# --- 核心原则：文本文件统一 LF，避免 Windows/Mac/Linux 换行符来回变 ---
* text=auto eol=lf

# --- 强制 CRLF：Windows 批处理脚本（双击运行，LF 换行会执行异常）---
*.bat text eol=crlf

# --- 强制 CRLF：Windows 计划任务/脚本（若有）---
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# --- 纯文本：统一 LF（源码 / 文档 / 配置）---
*.py text
*.js text
*.ts text
*.mjs text
*.json text
*.yaml text
*.yml text
*.md text
*.rst text
*.toml text
*.ini text
*.txt text
*.xml text
*.html text
*.css text
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# --- 二进制文件：标记 binary，git 不做文本 diff / 换行符转换 ---
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.whl binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary

# --- Playwright 浏览器 / 字体等（若被误加入）---
chromium-* binary
ffmpeg-* binary
